<chapter xml:id="communication">
  <title>Communicating Results</title>
  <section xml:id="communication-claim">
    <title>Say what the analysis supports</title>
    <p>A good analysis separates what was observed, what was estimated, what assumptions were made, and what remains uncertain. A statistically significant result is not automatically a large, useful, or causal effect.</p>
  </section>
</chapter>
